+<div id="fallback" class="panel" hidden>
+  <p>This exhibit needs WebGL. A reversible air conditioner moves heat: refrigerant circulates in a sealed loop, room air and outdoor air stay separate, and heating swaps the two heat exchangers.</p>
+</div>
+<script type="importmap">
+{
